      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "KaynQ",
        "name": "Reaping Slash",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Kayn dashes, then slashes. Both deal damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "Kayn dashes then spins his scythe, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(75/105/135/165/195 + ([[si:scalead]]85% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to enemies he passes through, then deals the damage again to nearby enemies.<br /><br />Kayn dashes then spins his scythe, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(75/105/135/165/195 + ([[si:scalead]]85% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to enemies he passes through, then deals the damage again to nearby enemies.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Darkin Slayer:</span> Instead deal <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">([[si:scalead]]65% Attack Damage) plus (6% + ([[si:scalead]]3.5% per 100 bonus Attack Damage)) max Health physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">40 physical damage</span> to minions and jungle monsters (max: 200/250/300/350/400).</span>",
