        "id": "KaynW",
        "name": "Blade's Reach",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Kayn damages and slows targets in a line.",
        "bodyHtml": "Kayn swipes his scythe upward, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(85/130/175/220/265 + ([[si:scalead]]110% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> enemies hit by 90%, decaying over 1.5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Shadow Assassin:</span> Kayn can move while using this Ability and increases its range.<br /><br />Kayn swipes his scythe upward, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(85/130/175/220/265 + ([[si:scalead]]110% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> enemies hit by 90%, decaying over 1.5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Darkin Slayer:</span> Additionally <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks Up</span> enemies hit for 1 second.",
