      "E": {
        "slot": "E",
        "id": "KaynE",
        "name": "Shadow Step",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Kayn can walk through terrain.",
        "bodyHtml": "Kayn gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">40% Move Speed</span>, becomes Ghosted, and can move through Terrain for 7/7.5/8/8.5/9 seconds. When he first enters terrain, he restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(90/100/110/120/130 + ([[si:scalead]]45% bonus Attack Damage)) Health</span>.<br /><br />Being <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Immobilized</span> and spending more than 1.5 consecutive seconds outside of Terrain ends this Ability early.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Shadow Assassin:</span> Gain <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">70% Move Speed</span>, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slow</span> immunity, and reduce the Cooldown to 10 seconds.<br /><br />Kayn gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">40% Move Speed</span>, becomes Ghosted, and can move through Terrain for 7/7.5/8/8.5/9 seconds. When he first enters terrain, he restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(90/100/110/120/130 + ([[si:scalead]]45% bonus Attack Damage)) Health</span>.<br /><br />Being <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Immobilized</span> and spending more than 1.5 consecutive seconds outside of Terrain ends this Ability early.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Ghosted units can pass through other units.<br />Maximum duration in combat with enemy champions is 1.5 seconds.<br /></span>",
