      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "KaynR",
        "name": "Umbral Trespass",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Kayn hides in an enemy's body, dealing massive damage when he bursts out.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Champions damaged by Kayn are marked for 3.15 seconds.<br /><br />Kayn infests a marked enemy, becoming Untargetable. After 2.5 seconds or after <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recasting</span>, Kayn bursts out, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + ([[si:scalead]]150% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to the enemy.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Shadow Assassin:</span> Increases this Ability's range, the distance Kayn exits, and refreshes <span>The Darkin Scythe's</span> Cooldown on exit.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Champions damaged by Kayn are marked for 3.15 seconds.<br /><br />Kayn infests a marked enemy, becoming Untargetable. After 2.5 seconds or after <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recasting</span>, Kayn bursts out, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + ([[si:scalead]]150% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span> to the enemy.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Darkin Slayer:</span> Instead deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(15% + ([[si:scalead]]0.1% bonus Attack Damage)) max Health physical damage</span> and restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(11.25% + (7.5% per 100 bonus Attack Damage)) Health</span> (75% damage amount).<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Untargetable units won't be affected by enemy Attacks or Abilities unless they've already been hit by them.</span>",
